# CR 510.2, PhaseHandler.java:339-341: when no combat damage is assigned
# (Ornithopter attacks with 0 power), the combat damage step deals none and
# grants no priority. After First Strike Damage (Upkeep, Main1, BeginCombat,
# Declare Attackers, Declare Blockers, First Strike Damage: six steps, turn 1
# skips its draw), human queues a mana ability; stepping into Combat Damage
# never asks for it, so the Mountain stays untapped and ai loses no life.
startturn human
queue attackers 1
queue attacktarget ai
step 6
queue action human tapformana 2 R
step
